      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为过于专注思考，\n琵琶晨光昨晚似乎没有睡饱……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bd64f82400c84b98b031ddbb4a673ab8268686b5b6a3655fdfcc92437e5a339",
