    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e4dfa52623f2f8109fbacd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从疲劳程度来计算，\n我一直认为要在六点前起床是不可能的。\n但是我──却早起了10分钟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0771940d98a63fba144c491297f54d862de9061f66ea346697012249235aa56b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1023/storytimeline_501023701.json",
      "json_path": [
